# Copy to .env (gitignored). PF_BASE_URL has NO default: left empty, direction 1 is off and nothing is ever contacted.
# Set it to the PingFederate you own, for example https://pf.example:9031 (https only; http on loopback).
PF_BASE_URL=
# Optional: limit which client_id hosts the lab's own teaching server will fetch from (comma list).
#ALLOWED_CLIENT_HOSTS=
# Optional: the local client.dev clone's document URL and callback, for the "client.dev local clone" preset
# (README "Run the real client.dev locally"). The lab serves the document at /client-dev-local.json.
#CIMD_CLIENT_DEV_LOCAL_URL=
#CIMD_CLIENT_DEV_LOCAL_REDIRECT=
